# Files rsconnect must never upload.
#
# R/manifest.R
R/generate_manifest.R
generate_manifest.R passes an explicit file list to writeManifest(), so this
# is the belt-and-braces for anyone who deploys straight from the RStudio button
# or with rsconnect::deployApp() instead.
#
# .RData and .Rhistory are the reason this file exists: they are an R session's
# saved workspace and command history. If a dataset was loaded when the
# workspace was written, deploying the directory uploads respondent data to a
# hosted server.
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user
.git
.gitignore
tests
outputs
docs/loa-schema.md
R/manifest.R
R/generate_manifest.R
generate_manifest.R
manifest.json
